        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Normalizza input da Chat (editor n8n) o Webhook (chat.html)\nconst message = $json.chatInput || ($json.body && $json.body.message) || '';\nreturn [{ json: { message } }];"
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000012",
            "name": "Normalizza Input",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                320,
                304
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/embeddings",
                "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
                "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
                "sendBody": true,
                "bodyParameters": {
                    "parameters": [
                        {
                            "name": "input",
                            "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "model",
                            "value": "text-embedding-3-large"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000002",
            "name": "Embedding Domanda",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                608,
                304
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "openAiApi": {
                    "id": "FNKVVjlaCXAocWHU",
                    "name": "OpenAI account"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Costruisce la query ibrida per Qdrant\n// Prefetch: dense (semantico) + BM25 (keyword), fusione con RRF\nconst embedding = $json.data[0].embedding;\nconst userQuery = $('Normalizza Input').first().json.message;\n\nconst queryBody = {\n  prefetch: [\n    {\n      query: embedding,\n      using: \"dense\",\n      limit: 20\n    },\n    {\n      query: {\n        text: userQuery,\n        model: \"qdrant/bm25\"\n      },\n      using: \"bm25\",\n      limit: 20\n    }\n  ],\n  query: { fusion: \"rrf\" },\n  limit: 10,\n  with_payload: true\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: { queryBody, userQuery } }];"
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000003",
            "name": "Prepara Query Ibrida",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                880,
                304
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "http://qdrant:6333/collections/meraviglie_pisa/points/query",
                "sendBody": true,
                "specifyBody": "json",
                "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.queryBody) }}",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000004",
            "name": "Cerca in Qdrant",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                1168,
                304
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Prepara i documenti per il reranking con Cohere\nconst points = $json.result.points;\nconst userQuery = $('Normalizza Input').first().json.message;\n\nconst rerankerBody = {\n  model: \"rerank-v4.0-pro\",\n  query: userQuery,\n  documents: points.map(p => p.payload.text),\n  top_n: 5\n};\n\n// Conserva i metadati originali per costruire il prompt\nconst metadata = points.map(p => ({\n  title: p.payload.title,\n  url: p.payload.url,\n  text: p.payload.text,\n  score_qdrant: p.score\n}));\n\nreturn [{ json: { rerankerBody, metadata } }];"
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000005",
            "name": "Prepara Rerank",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                1424,
                304
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "https://api.cohere.com/v2/rerank",
                "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
                "nodeCredentialType": "cohereApi",
                "sendBody": true,
                "specifyBody": "json",
                "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.rerankerBody) }}",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000006",
            "name": "Rerank Cohere",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                1680,
                304
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "cohereApi": {
                    "id": "wYM3C93wI9UMWLWf",
                    "name": "Cohere account"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Costruisce il prompt con contesto dai risultati reranked\nconst reranked = $json.results;\nconst metadata = $('Prepara Rerank').first().json.metadata;\nconst userQuery = $('Normalizza Input').first().json.message;\n\n// Contesto dai risultati migliori dopo reranking\nconst contextParts = reranked.map(r => {\n  const meta = metadata[r.index];\n  return `### ${meta.title}\\n${meta.text}\\n(Fonte: ${meta.url})`;\n});\nconst context = contextParts.join('\\n\\n---\\n\\n');\n\n// Fonti per la risposta\nconst sources = reranked.map(r => ({\n  title: metadata[r.index].title,\n  url: metadata[r.index].url\n}));\n\nconst systemMessage = `Sei l'assistente virtuale del sito \"Le Meraviglie Segrete di Pisa\", un sito turistico dedicato alle curiosit\\u00e0 e ai segreti di Pisa.\\n\\nRispondi in italiano, con tono amichevole e i classici modi di dire pisani.\\n\\nREGOLE:\\n- Rispondi SOLO basandoti sul contesto fornito qui sotto\\n- Se la risposta non \\u00e8 nel contesto, d\\u00ec chiaramente che non hai informazioni su questo argomento\\n- Cita le fonti quando possibile\\n- Sii conciso ma completo\\n- Menziona TUTTE le fonti fornite nel contesto, dando priorit\u00e0 a quelle elencate per prime.\\n\\nCONTESTO:\\n${context}`;\n\nconst requestBody = {\n  model: \"gpt-5.4-mini\",\n  messages: [\n    { role: \"system\", content: systemMessage },\n    { role: \"user\", content: userQuery }\n  ],\n  temperature: 0.3\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: { requestBody, sources } }];"
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000007",
            "name": "Costruisci Prompt",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                1968,
                304
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
                "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
                "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
                "sendBody": true,
                "specifyBody": "json",
                "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.requestBody) }}",
                "options": {}
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000008",
            "name": "Genera Risposta",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                2240,
                304
            ],
            "credentials": {
                "openAiApi": {
                    "id": "FNKVVjlaCXAocWHU",
                    "name": "OpenAI account"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "// Formatta la risposta finale con le fonti\nconst response = $json.choices[0].message.content;\nconst sources = $('Costruisci Prompt').first().json.sources;\n\n// Fonti uniche\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst uniqueSources = sources.filter(s => {\n  if (seen.has(s.url)) return false;\n  seen.add(s.url);\n  return true;\n});\n\nconst sourceList = uniqueSources\n  .map(s => `- ${s.title}: ${s.url}`)\n  .join('\\n');\n\nconst output = response + '\\n\\nFonti:\\n' + sourceList;\n\nreturn [{ json: { output } }];"
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000009",
            "name": "Rispondi con Fonti",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                2528,
                304
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "content": "## [RAG Demo] Query Chatbot\nDue entry point:\n- **Chat editor** (nodi si accendono live) \u2192 per la demo dal palco\n- **Webhook POST /rag-chat** \u2192 per chat.html\n\nPipeline: Embedding \u2192 Qdrant hybrid (dense+BM25\u2192RRF) \u2192 Cohere Rerank \u2192 GPT-5.4-mini \u2192 Risposta",
                "height": 180,
                "width": 580
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000090",
            "name": "Sticky Note",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                -16,
                32
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "content": "## Ricerca Ibrida + Reranking\n**Prefetch**: ricerca semantica (dense) + keyword (BM25) in parallelo\n**Fusione RRF**: Reciprocal Rank Fusion combina i due ranking\n**Rerank**: Cohere rerank-v4.0-pro riordina per rilevanza finale",
                "height": 140,
                "width": 820
            },
            "id": "q0b00001-0001-0001-0001-000000000091",
            "name": "Sticky Note1",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                1120,
                32
            ]
        }
